# Tailscale MCP

This is a mcp-server repository for Tailscale MCP development.

## Project structure

- `src/` -- TypeScript source (`src/index.ts` entry point, `src/config.ts` env parsing)
- `src/providers/` -- `TailscaleProvider` interface (`types.ts`) and `CliProvider`
- `src/tools/` -- MCP tools, registered with `registerTool` (title, annotations, output schema)
- `src/__tests__/` -- vitest suites, offline with a mocked CLI runner
- `package.json` -- npm package manifest

## Conventions

- Use conventional commits (feat:, fix:, chore:, docs:)
- Bump the version in package.json in your PR; CI tags and publishes it
- mcp-tools.json is generated: run `npm run gen:tools` after changing a tool
- Provider adapters live in src/providers/; tools live in src/tools/
- Pin GitHub Actions by commit SHA with a version comment
